                            <comment id="16660317" author="roman_s" created="Tue, 23 Oct 2018 09:10:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Actually, it can acquire only the first object in the row, no matter what the type is.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16668763" author="isapego" created="Tue, 30 Oct 2018 14:14:46 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=roman_s&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;roman_s&quot;&gt;roman_s&lt;/a&gt;, can you please provide your output? I can&apos;t reproduce the issue.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16668818" author="roman_s" created="Tue, 30 Oct 2018 14:53:51 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=isapego&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;isapego&quot;&gt;isapego&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

